      "text": "<h2>Overview</h2><p>Mega Dragonite is valuable addition to a conventional raid battle parties with its ability to provide lv 4 boosted XL candy chances from successful catches. It also has the potential to gain a +move possibly pushing increasing its value in PVE for the future.</p><h4>Est Time to Win: 150.0s - 230.0s </h4><h2>Main Strategy</h2><p>Mega Dragonite has a double weakness to ice although can be defeated using dragon roster. This strategy revolves around using Kyurem Fusions and adapting their roles / battle party sizes to different movesets. </p><h3>#1 <a href=\"https://soloraidarchive.github.io/solo-raid-mechanics.html#strategy-hot-swap\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Hot-Swap</strong></a><strong> Route: </strong></h3><p><strong>Against: Dragon Claw, Hurricane, Thunder Punch </strong>it is recommended to simply DPS through the charge moves. Make sure to manage your health accordingly and don't get caught losing energy due to fainting. </p><h3>#2 <a href=\"https://soloraidarchive.github.io/solo-raid-mechanics.html#strategy-hot-swap\" target=\"_blank\">Hot-swap</a> + <a href=\"https://soloraidarchive.github.io/solo-raid-mechanics.html#strategy-catch-tank\" target=\"_blank\">Catch Tank</a> Route: </h3><p><strong>Against: Outrage, Hyper Beam, Superpower: </strong>It is recommended to DPS however adapt in to <a href=\"https://soloraidarchive.github.io/solo-raid-mechanics.html#strategy-catch-tank\" target=\"_blank\">catch tanking</a> in the appropriate situation. </p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Kyurem Blacks enormous bulk means itcan sponge lots of energy from Outrage, Hyperbeam and Superpower allowing it to cast Freeze shock very quickly. <a href=\"https://soloraidarchive.github.io/ct-calculator.html?\" target=\"_blank\">Outrage Catch Tank DPS</a> </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>The more Kyurem blacks invested, the faster the challenge ends. Although high rejoin counts can be expected, the damage is so high it far exceeds the setback of relobby time. </li></ol><p><br></p><h2><br></h2><p><br></p>",
